OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifters carrying shopping
OL,4,Alists, says M&S manager
OL,5,
OL,6,FShoplifters walk into branches of Marks
OL,7,F& Spencer with a list in an attempt to
OL,8,Fget away with hauls worth thousands of
OL,9,Fpounds, a regional manager says.
OL,11,FElisa Lewis, who is responsible for M&S
OL,12,Fshops in Shropshire, said shoplifting
OL,13,Fwas a "really large issue" and could be
OL,14,F"a daily, possibly even hourly,
OL,15,Foccurrence".
OL,17,F"In my experience it can be anybody,"
OL,18,Fshe said. "It can be a bored housewife
OL,19,Fwho's just nicking a jacket for a bit
OL,20,Fof fun, and the people who we do catch
OL,21,Fare sometimes those we least expect."
